  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I set the default status for VRC Parameters and synced the defaults for the FX animator controller, but when a mobile user uses a cross-platform avatar, all default \"True\" states seem to be rewritten to \"false\" when viewed on a PC device.\n\nThe animation is forced to false, which is causing problems for mobile users, as they don't realize that they're not wearing a jacket.\n\nI looked into it but couldn't find a solution.\n\nPlease let me know if there is a solution.",
